                <pb facs="0539" n="469" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg469"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.154/532: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hanna</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-21T16:00:00-05:00">March 21, 1934—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>16. We fully approve of your action as described in your No. 30 of March 19, 6
                    p.m., regarding the inter-American highway.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
